<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡσαύτως</span></b> , Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ αὐτός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in like manner, just so,</i>
			used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only at the beginning of clauses with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέ</span> inserted, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς δ᾽
			αὔτως</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.339
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.31
			</span></i>, al.; also in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.215
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				102e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1386b30
			</span></i>, al.; after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, in one word, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡσαύτως καὶ</span>
			. . <i>in like manner</i> as . . <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.86
			</span></i>, etc.; c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς δ᾽ αὔτως τῇσι κυσὶ οἱ ἰχνευταὶ
					θάπτονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.67
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὶ συνεξήκουον ὡ. ἐμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					372
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ γὰρ . . , ὡ. δὲ σύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἑτέρως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				169a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> further
			strengthd., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡ. οὕτως</span> so <i>in
				like manner,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				460d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡ. κατὰ ταὐτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					78d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
